OL,3,GNEWSAFarming and music festival to move
OL,4,Ato showground
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new farming and music festival will
OL,7,Fmove to a Berkshire showground for its
OL,8,Fsecond event next year.
OL,10,FThe Great British Farm-Fest, held for
OL,11,Fthe first time this year, will take
OL,12,Fplace at Newbury Showground from 29 to
OL,13,F31 May 2027.
OL,15,FFormer Top Gear presenter Jeremy
OL,16,FClarkson, who will front the event,
OL,17,Fsaid it combined a traditional country
OL,18,Ffair with a modern music festival.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
