OL,3,GNEWSAFarming and music festival to move
OL,4,Ato showground
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaking place in May at Stoneleigh Park
OL,7,Fin Warwickshire, the inaugural event
OL,8,Ffeatured more than 400 stalls and 12
OL,9,Farenas across 300 acres, and attracted
OL,10,Fmore than 50,000 visitors.
